      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Impressive detached period residence \r\nApproximately 2,100 sq. ft. \r\nSet on approximately 0.6 acres \r\nExtensively refurbished and upgraded over the past two years \r\nUp to five bedrooms \r\nMultiple reception rooms \r\nHigh ceilings and excellent room proportions \r\nPeriod character throughout \r\nSash-style windows fitted 2 years ago\r\nNew oil burner\r\nInsulation in attic and sunroom\r\nDecorative coving \r\nOpen fireplaces and fitted stoves \r\nSuperb kitchen/dining/living area \r\nLarge garden room/conservatory \r\nPotential guest/independent accommodation \r\nMature private gardens \r\nStone outbuilding \r\nGarden shed and chicken house \r\nFully tarmacked driveway \r\nAmple parking \r\nLocated in the heart of An Rinn Gaeltacht \r\nApproximately 10 minutes from Dungarvan \r\nConvenient to Helvick, Ardmore, beaches and the Waterford Greenway \r\n\r\nAirport Distances\r\nCork Airport: approximately 1 hour\r\nWaterford: approximately 55 minutes\r\nDublin Airport: approximately 2 hours\r\nCeol na Mara is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial period home with genuine character, extensive accommodation and beautiful mature gardens in one of West Waterford's most sought-after coastal locations. Viewing is highly recommended."
